00:00:19.677 --> 00:00:21.260
ANIL DHAWAN: Thank
you for joining us.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.926
I know it's the last
session of the day.

00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:25.230
So thank you for hanging on.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.876
It's going to be awesome talk.

00:00:26.876 --> 00:00:28.140
Let me introduce myself.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:29.172
My name is Anil Dhawan.

00:00:29.172 --> 00:00:32.090
I'm a product manager on
