00:30:01.480 --> 00:30:05.140
exactly the picture
that I just showed you.

00:30:05.140 --> 00:30:07.900
So I have a nextdemo.

00:30:07.900 --> 00:30:10.360
And then what I have is I
have created a new high level

00:30:10.360 --> 00:30:13.040
type called ha-service.

00:30:13.040 --> 00:30:15.740
And you can see it
right there on the top.

00:30:15.740 --> 00:30:18.440
It says oh, you
