00:31:34.430 --> 00:31:37.060
It allows you to take a
managed instance group

00:31:37.060 --> 00:31:39.250
and give it a couple of
images, and it'll handle

00:31:39.250 --> 00:31:40.680
the rolling update for you.

00:31:40.680 --> 00:31:46.820
So in this case, we have
updated from Ubuntu into Santos.

00:31:46.820 --> 00:31:51.260
And it also has
an instance group,

00:31:51.260 --> 00:31:55.130
and it has an order
