00:31:55.130 --> 00:31:59.490
So this is ha-service
type it's very powerful,

00:31:59.490 --> 00:32:02.190
because it basically
takes in maybe about five

00:32:02.190 --> 00:32:03.340
or six properties.

00:32:03.340 --> 00:32:05.020
It takes some order
