nodes in the replica set.

00:39:45.490 --> 00:39:48.480
So let's go ahead and
query the status of that.

00:39:48.480 --> 00:39:50.520
And as you can see
here, the replica set

00:39:50.520 --> 00:39:52.080
is set up the way we want.

00:39:52.080 --> 00:39:54.260
We have, namely, a primary.

00:39:54.260 --> 00:39:55.760
We have a secondary.

00:39:55.760 --> 00:39:57.620
And then we have that arbiter.

00:39:57.620 --> 00:39:59.820
And what we've done behind
