00:40:05.980 --> 00:40:08.220
making sure each node
can talk to each other.

00:40:08.220 --> 00:40:11.370
And you've seen this deployed
in just a matter of seconds

00:40:11.370 --> 00:40:12.140
really.

00:40:12.140 --> 00:40:14.350
And just a proof of that,
the deployment I kicked off

00:40:14.350 --> 00:40:15.474
