00:40:15.474 --> 00:40:17.626
And we can do the same there.

00:40:17.626 --> 00:40:19.000
Let's go back to
our slides here.

00:40:21.690 --> 00:40:23.575
So hopefully, what
we just saw is

00:40:23.575 --> 00:40:26.790
