00:41:24.764 --> 00:41:26.180
First, as we talked
about earlier,

00:41:26.180 --> 00:41:29.530
is this notion of using
immutable infrastructure

00:41:29.530 --> 00:41:31.710
with repeatable deployments.

00:41:31.710 --> 00:41:33.230
It's going to
increase the chances

00:41:33.230 --> 00:41:34.438
that it's just going to work.

00:41:34.438 --> 00:41:35.030
Right?

00:41:35.030 --> 00:41:37.670
You're going to go
from having deployments

00:41:37.670 --> 00:41:40.670
