to replicate again,

00:41:42.510 --> 00:41:45.650
to something you can
stamp out repeatedly.

00:41:45.650 --> 00:41:47.210
Deployment Manager,
as we've seen,

00:41:47.210 --> 00:41:49.790
is our Google Cloud
Platform native tool

00:41:49.790 --> 00:41:51.540
