00:41:51.540 --> 00:41:53.480
It can deploy
resources and images,

00:41:53.480 --> 00:41:58.418
whether it's VM
images or containers.

00:41:58.418 --> 00:42:02.100
And Cloud Launcher solutions
are a great way to get started,

00:42:02.100 --> 00:42:03.622
but not just to kick the tires.

00:42:03.622 --> 00:42:05.370
You can use them in
